    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your dragonmark is erratic, dangerous, and feared by the Twelve. Whether recruited by House Tarkanan in the lower ruins of Sharn or hiding on the run, you wield destructive aberrant power and an uncanny survival instinct.</p><p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Constitution</strong> or <strong>Charisma</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p><p>You're trained in the <strong>Intimidation</strong> skill and the <strong>Underworld Lore</strong> skill. You gain the <strong>Intimidating Glare</strong> skill feat. You have access to Aberrant Mark feats.</p>"
